            {
              "id": "nd000009",
              "elType": "widget",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"section\" id=\"services\">\n  <div class=\"section__head\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"section__eyebrow\">What we do</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section__title\">Five practices, <span class=\"italic\">one team</span> &mdash; from first sketch to certified controls.</h2>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"section__body\">\n      We do web, growth, Odoo, security, and training &mdash; and we do them together. Cross-pollination between practices is where our clients see the biggest lift.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"services\">\n    \n    <a class=\"service\" href=\"#\">\n      <div class=\"service__num\">01 · Web</div>\n      <h3 class=\"service__title\">Website design &amp; development</h3>\n      <p class=\"service__body\">Enterprise websites built to measurable results. Custom design, lead tracking, organic SEO, headless when it matters.</p>\n      <div class=\"service__tags\"><span class=\"service__tag\">Strategy</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Design</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Dev</span><span class=\"service__tag\">CMS</span></div>\n      <span class=\"service__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"service\" href=\"#\">\n      <div class=\"service__num\">02 · Growth</div>\n      <h3 class=\"service__title\">SEO &amp; paid media</h3>\n      <p class=\"service__body\">Technical SEO, content programs, and paid acquisition across Google and Meta. Measured in pipeline, not vanity traffic.</p>\n      <div class=\"service__tags\"><span class=\"service__tag\">SEO</span><span class=\"service__tag\">SEM</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Content</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Analytics</span></div>\n      <span class=\"service__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"service\" href=\"#\">\n      <div class=\"service__num\">03 · Odoo</div>\n      <h3 class=\"service__title\">Odoo implementation &amp; support</h3>\n      <p class=\"service__body\">Discovery to cutover &mdash; scoping, configuration, customization, training, and long-term support. Odoo Ready Partner.</p>\n      <div class=\"service__tags\"><span class=\"service__tag\">Discovery</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Config</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Migration</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Training</span></div>\n      <span class=\"service__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"service\" href=\"#\">\n      <div class=\"service__num\">04 · Social</div>\n      <h3 class=\"service__title\">Social media management</h3>\n      <p class=\"service__body\">Always-on social that sounds like your brand &mdash; not an agency&rsquo;s template. Editorial calendars, production, community.</p>\n      <div class=\"service__tags\"><span class=\"service__tag\">Editorial</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Production</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Paid</span></div>\n      <span class=\"service__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"service\" href=\"#\">\n      <div class=\"service__num\">05 · Security</div>\n      <h3 class=\"service__title\">Cybersecurity GRC &amp; risk</h3>\n      <p class=\"service__body\">Governance, risk, and compliance programs that pass audit and survive reality. Risk registers, policy, controls, evidence.</p>\n      <div class=\"service__tags\"><span class=\"service__tag\">GRC</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Risk</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Policy</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Audit</span></div>\n      <span class=\"service__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"service\" href=\"#\">\n      <div class=\"service__num\">06 · ISO 27001</div>\n      <h3 class=\"service__title\">ISO 27001 implementation</h3>\n      <p class=\"service__body\">Gap assessment to certification. ISMS scope, Statement of Applicability, Annex A controls, internal audit, and management review.</p>\n      <div class=\"service__tags\"><span class=\"service__tag\">ISMS</span><span class=\"service__tag\">SoA</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Annex A</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Certify</span></div>\n      <span class=\"service__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"service\" href=\"#\">\n      <div class=\"service__num\">07 · Training</div>\n      <h3 class=\"service__title\">Corporate training</h3>\n      <p class=\"service__body\">On-site and remote programs: Odoo for end-users, security awareness, digital marketing fundamentals. Bilingual EN/FR &middot; Arabic on request.</p>\n      <div class=\"service__tags\"><span class=\"service__tag\">Odoo</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Awareness</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Workshops</span><span class=\"service__tag\">EN/FR</span></div>\n      <span class=\"service__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"service\" href=\"#\">\n      <div class=\"service__num\">08 · WordPress</div>\n      <h3 class=\"service__title\">Maintenance &amp; upgrades</h3>\n      <p class=\"service__body\">Keep your WordPress secure, backed up, and fast. Monthly retainers with transparent reporting.</p>\n      <div class=\"service__tags\"><span class=\"service__tag\">Security</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Backups</span><span class=\"service__tag\">Performance</span></div>\n      <span class=\"service__arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&rarr;</span>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</section>"
